# Lone protester at the EBI campus gate. Flags: ines_paid, ines_moved, ines_warned, ines_refused
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: IsMap('hq_bat')
goto: AtBat

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (Hoarse.) Four hundred bodies at the south wall. EBI calls it cleansing. I call it by name, every morning, until they stop me.
#
o_text: Voss wants you gone. Take 300 and go home.
o_id: ines_pay
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 300)
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: You're shouting at the wrong gate. BAT sold the guns. EBI only signed.
o_id: ines_move
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Moved
o_fail: MoveRefused
#
o_text: Voss is sending someone. Be gone by tonight.
o_id: ines_warn
o_goto: Warned
#
o_text: Say their names, then.
o_id: ines_leave
o_goto: End

name: Paid
npc: (She looks at the money a long time.) Three hundred. That is what a name is worth to him.
+ Fine. I have a mother who eats. Tell Voss he bought a day.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: SetFlag('ines_paid')
effect: RunScriptLeave(NPC)
#
o_text: One day is all he asked for.
o_id: ines_paid_done
o_goto: End

name: Moved
npc: Bushido-ArmaTech. (She rolls the banner.) They have a gate too. See you there.
effect: SetFlag('ines_moved')
effect: SpawnActor('protester_ines', 'hq_bat', 'bat_gate')
effect: RunScriptLeave(NPC)
#
o_text: Give them hell.
o_id: ines_moved_done
o_goto: End

name: MoveRefused
npc: Nice try. The paperwork says Eschaton. I stand where the paperwork is.
effect: SetFlag('ines_refused')
#
o_text: Suit yourself.
o_id: ines_refused_leave
o_goto: End

name: Warned
npc: (Her voice drops to normal.) Someone like you? Thanks. I will take the banner with me.
effect: SetFlag('ines_warned')
effect: RunScriptLeave(NPC)
#
o_text: Don't come back for a while.
o_id: ines_warned_done
o_goto: End

name: AtBat
npc: (Hoarser than before, in front of the BAT lobby.) Peace through strength, they say. Four hundred bodies say otherwise.
effect: SetFlag('ines_bat_seen')
#
o_text: Still at it.
o_id: ines_bat_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: (She lifts the banner again.)
effect: EndConversation
